WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:03.923
Unit three. Social Responsibility!

2
00:00:04.935 --> 00:00:11.378
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English, Level six!

3
00:00:11.428 --> 00:00:14.811
Hi, Teacher Vibol! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.861 --> 00:00:19.042
Today we learn: Social Responsibility. Let's go!

5
00:00:20.502 --> 00:00:25.752
Ethical obligation. Say it with me. Ethical obligation!

6
00:00:29.261 --> 00:00:33.595
Community impact. Say it with me. Community impact!

7
00:00:37.063 --> 00:00:42.147
Corporate responsibility. Say it with me. Corporate responsibility!

8
00:00:45.671 --> 00:00:50.254
Social contract. Say it with me. Social contract!

9
00:00:53.733 --> 00:00:57.999
Collective action. Say it with me. Collective action!

10
00:01:01.478 --> 00:01:05.228
Public good. Say it with me. Public good!

11
00:01:08.755 --> 00:01:13.089
Accountability. Say it with me. Accountability!

12
00:01:16.599 --> 00:01:20.416
Moral duty. Say it with me. Moral duty!

13
00:01:23.889 --> 00:01:29.089
Sustainable practice. Say it with me. Sustainable practice!

14
00:01:32.621 --> 00:01:37.671
Shared responsibility. Say it with me. Shared responsibility!

15
00:01:41.161 --> 00:01:45.445
Civic virtue. Say it with me. Civic virtue!

16
00:01:48.915 --> 00:01:52.981
Global impact. Say it with me. Global impact!

17
00:01:56.517 --> 00:02:05.965
Grammar time! Modal perfect (should have). Listen. We should have acted sooner to protect the community.

18
00:02:06.015 --> 00:02:11.558
Your turn. Say it with me. We should have acted sooner to protect the community.

19
00:02:16.361 --> 00:02:26.441
Social responsibility involves an ethical obligation to consider community impact. Collective action and shared responsibility protect the public good.

20
00:02:26.491 --> 00:02:27.986
I like this story!

21
00:02:29.113 --> 00:02:34.351
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:34.401 --> 00:02:36.330
Corporate responsibility!

23
00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:42.535
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:42.585 --> 00:02:43.955
Accountability!

25
00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:54.485
Think and answer. What social responsibility do you feel toward your community?

26
00:02:54.535 --> 00:02:55.698
Great answer!

27
00:02:56.842 --> 00:03:01.563
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

28
00:03:01.613 --> 00:03:03.218
Bye-bye, friends!

